{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1301031-hack-exalted-3rd-storypath-conversion","id":1301031,"title":"[Hack] Exalted 3rd Storypath Conversion","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-03-29T22:05:37-07:00","id":1301031,"title":"[Hack] Exalted 3rd Storypath Conversion","content":"Here's a hack to convert Exalted 3rd Edition to the new Storypath system. It is not 100% complete and hasn't been playtested yet.<br /> <br /> Leave any comments or feedback.<br /> <br /> You will need the Exalted and a Storypath book to use this doc.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1kfRGRpMJW9T7XSKRQGu5dpINx61VAYza\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1kfRGRpMJW9T7XSKRQGu5dpINx61VAYza\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1kfRGRpMJW9T7XSKRQGu5dpINx61VAYza\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/open?id=1kfRGRpMJW9T7XSKRQGu5dpINx61VAYza </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25184-chaoticsilly","name":"chaoticsilly","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-30T10:07:42-07:00","id":1301091,"title":"","content":"Very nice. I was waiting for someone to eventually convert this. But\u2026<ul><li>Dawn gets Enhancement 5 to\u2026 social rolls? Aren\u2019t the Zenith and Eclipse castes supposed to be the social roles? I\u2019m sorry I don\u2019t see this as a Dawn. Same thing with the Twilight and Night castes. I think you\u2019ll need to redo them to better fit their exalted roles. I mean Night\u2019s most commonly used (and abused) ability is to never flare their anima unless they really want to.</li> <li>So your limit break is based on the area you pick your Origin Path from? Is this the only one you\u2019ll have?</li> <li>You can only deal decisive damage when someone has zero momentum, but you can take an action to reset this willingly. I\u2019m sorry what? What makes opponents not take such an action immediately in order to avoid getting ganked? If all it takes to recover from a crash is a safe, diceless action then its quite possible to indefinitely lock up 1v1 combat.</li> </ul><br /> Charms are something I have a bigger issue about. I mean as a proof of concept it works but so many things can be pointed out. Inconsistency of scale benefits across charm in particular. Scale ie the one big thing Storypath has over Storyteller in that it can used as a tool to quickly modify sizes and damages. Not only that the effects are severely cut off. There are no FoS charms, just one that gives Enhancement 3 on all rolls before then. Scion 2e has more options, so I think you\u2019ll need to redesign the concept of charms and how scale fits into them from the ground up.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://for